<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch Febrary cash retail sales rise 1.8 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Dutch Febrary cash retail sales rise 1.8 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>VOORBURG, Netherlands 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch retail sales rose 1.8 percent in cash terms in February compared with February 1996, the Central Bureau of Statistics (CBS) said.</p>
<p>In volume terms February retail sales were 1.6 percent higher than in February 1996, the CBS added.</p>
</text>
